{"1923960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unmurk", "steam_appid": 1923960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist puzzle game where you assemble puzzles on voxel objects and watch them come to life. You only see the outer edges of the puzzle, and by rotating the object and matching the puzzle pieces, the voxel object eventually comes to life. After completing the puzzle, you can interact with the object and search for hidden achievements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Put the puzzle together and watch the voxel object come to life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/776493af92ab9fc197556733c89c0906.poster.avif?t=1787926941\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/776493af92ab9fc197556733c89c0906.webm?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/776493af92ab9fc197556733c89c0906.mp4?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two difficulty modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy:</strong> puzzle pieces load gradually and the time between hints is shorter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/fa47f14df536f667b747d1bcd22ad56b.poster.avif?t=1787926941\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/fa47f14df536f667b747d1bcd22ad56b.webm?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/fa47f14df536f667b747d1bcd22ad56b.mp4?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard:</strong> all puzzle pieces load simultaneously, making it difficult to find the correct spot for each puzzle piece. The time between hints is longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/7a4d83cb8a02343c96456c584d777e8c.poster.avif?t=1787926941\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/7a4d83cb8a02343c96456c584d777e8c.webm?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/7a4d83cb8a02343c96456c584d777e8c.mp4?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist puzzle game where you assemble puzzles on voxel objects and watch them come to life. You only see the outer edges of the puzzle, and by rotating the object and matching the puzzle pieces, the voxel object eventually comes to life. After completing the puzzle, you can interact with the object and search for hidden achievements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Put the puzzle together and watch the voxel object come to life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/776493af92ab9fc197556733c89c0906.poster.avif?t=1787926941\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/776493af92ab9fc197556733c89c0906.webm?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/776493af92ab9fc197556733c89c0906.mp4?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two difficulty modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy:</strong> puzzle pieces load gradually and the time between hints is shorter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/fa47f14df536f667b747d1bcd22ad56b.poster.avif?t=1787926941\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/fa47f14df536f667b747d1bcd22ad56b.webm?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/fa47f14df536f667b747d1bcd22ad56b.mp4?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hard:</strong> all puzzle pieces load simultaneously, making it difficult to find the correct spot for each puzzle piece. The time between hints is longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/7a4d83cb8a02343c96456c584d777e8c.poster.avif?t=1787926941\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/7a4d83cb8a02343c96456c584d777e8c.webm?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1923960/extras/7a4d83cb8a02343c96456c584d777e8c.mp4?t=1787926941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A minimalist puz